Async Alembic environment for ASSETS.

The database URL is read from backend/.env via app.core.config, so you do not
need to set sqlalchemy.url in alembic.ini.

Common commands (run from the backend/ directory with the venv active):

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "create users table"
    alembic upgrade head
    alembic downgrade -1
    alembic current
    alembic history
